"(`joint_commands_topic`, `initialize_commands_from_state`, …): "
"[topic_based_ros2_control](../../4-reference/hardware/1-topic_based.md)."
msgstr ""
"`hardware:=isaac` 使用基于话题的驱动层，把 Isaac Sim 物理接到 ROS 2 control。插件 `<param>` "
"名（`joint_commands_topic`、`initialize_commands_from_state` "
"等）：[topic_based_ros2_control](../../4-reference/hardware/1-topic_based.md)。"

